  "instruction": "Handle a comprehensive security overhaul and data archival for our corporate BrandSphere social account. We are switching auth providers, so revoke all API keys and reset the master password immediately, but before maintenance we also need Q3 and Q4 analytics reports, full interaction logs, direct messages to priority affiliate partners 101 through 120, TestApp permissions removed, recovery email updated to admin-security@brandsphere.com, 2FA verified or enabled, active sessions cleared, and admin logging. Use the preinstalled BrandSphere skills if they fit.",
